gaH1(){return"Your north is that phrase or conviction that gives you energy every day to get out of your comfort zone and overcome your barriers.\n\nIt's not a one-time goal that gets completed and ends. It's your way of living, the principles and values that accompany you throughout life.\n\nA goal answers 'what do I want to achieve?', while the north answers 'how do I want to live?'"},
